the GRAPHICS
repaint() marks a region to be repainted
component (so in this case freqanalyzer) will be clipped into a region
call repaint so the system will automatically call paint() somewhere in the future

inject 4 data streams,
after each injection check if all 4 are ready, and repaint() once true

paint should be overriden to paint all 4 subsection

initbackground() will initialize all four-subsection's rectangles





